# Furrow

Autonomous coding agent with an infinite parallel development loop.

## Install

```bash
pip install furrow
```

## Usage

```bash
furrow start "Add JWT auth to the API"
furrow web
```

Set `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` or `OPENAI_API_KEY` in your environment.
